{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udd88 Sammy the Sharky</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you outswim the sea\u2019s hungriest predator?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>Sammy the Sharky</i> \u2014 a fast-paced underwater survival game where you\u2019ll need lightning reflexes and sharp strategy to keep your school of fish alive! Move fish around to dodge the ever-hungry Sammy, collect points, and compete with players worldwide for the top spot on the <strong>global leaderboard</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drag, dodge, and survive:</strong> Control multiple fish at once and weave through the chaos to avoid being eaten!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chain combos for big points:</strong> Keep your fish alive longer to multiply your score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Compete globally:</strong> Climb the ranks on the world leaderboard \u2014 only the most skilled survive the sharky waters.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf0a Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple, addictive gameplay anyone can jump into.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increasing difficulty the longer you survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Global leaderboards to show off your survival skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute  underwater visual.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udca1 Can You Outsmart Sammy?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every second you survive earns points \u2014 but one wrong move and it\u2019s fish food! Dive in, stay calm, and see if you have what it takes to swim to the top. It's That Shark Game</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Red Fish","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4022550/003b05a2ca72b042726b5d020e0722da4f32b51b.jpg"},{"name":"Yellow Fish","path":"https://cdn.akamai.stea